# str-length: multi-byte UTF-8 — counts codepoints not bytes
# "café" = c, a, f, é — 4 codepoints (é is 2 bytes but 1 codepoint)
[include %libdir "strings.llt"]
---
[call %.str-length "café"]
=== error
[E001] key not found: str-length (did you mean: 'str-at') (defined at 2:1-2:32) (accessed at 4:7-4:19)
  in accessing .str-length at 4:7-4:19
  in materialized at 4:1-4:27
  in [<dot-access> ...] at 4:1-4:27
